// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 05-statements/local_write_late_init_binary_neg_01.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// An initializer-less binding whose first write is a binary expression reads
// the uninitialized target in the write value. The late-init lowering slice
// admits only literal/parameter write values, so this checker-admitted body
// fails closed as ZOM4099 rather than reaching an ir-phase incident.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/05-statements/local_write_late_init_binary_neg_01.zom:3:5
